 "sentences": [
  "Our solar system has a massive protective bubble called the heliosphere.",
  "Interstellar cold clouds have pushed against this bubble in the past.",
  "This caused the heliosphere to shrink smaller than Earth's orbit.",
  "Our planet was exposed to entirely different galactic surroundings.",
  "These ancient cosmic encounters may have driven Earth's ice ages.",
  "NASA is using computer models to trace this hidden history."
